itas, * et devotiónem no¬</l><l xml:id="m-b590eafa-f2be-4c5f-a634-2b4c604e0100" facs="#m-e4225269-d341-41bd-9394-1807eb24a04a" label="lyrics-like">1 Deus: tut beáti Remigii Con-Ibis áugeat et salútem. Per Dómi¬</l><l xml:id="m-494347e6-8cf5-44aa-b28d-4a1ce98df1e1" facs="#m-d6c9a170-2697-4d5d-a96d-f2386a1aa1b1" label="lyrics-like">fessóris tui atque Pontificis venerán-] num.</l><l xml:id="m-dfb14dd6-04b5-42f1-ba3a-e54f4bf76583" facs="#m-85f935a9-21f9-4ca2-b8f3-f7bd723662f9" label="text-like">The Holy Guardian Angels. Double Major.</l><l xml:id="m-5242cf50-470d-44b1-91f8-d29dc3dfdcfc" facs="#m-025313ba-fa91-4f10-99d1-ae2111c92727" label="ambiguous">2.</l><l xml:id="m-8d40d350-9632-4098-8f1f-a59c961cc015" facs="#m-b83b66da-6802-4c6e-9bae-7007301859e5" label="text-like">At First Vespers.</l><l xml:id="m-efcab87e-1635-4972-94aa-3a4a31b3586a" facs="#m-5f17fff7-b563-4388-9645-af8ca3fce622" label="lyrics-like">All as at second Vespers, p. 1665, except the fifth Psalm, which is Laudáte</l><l xml:id="m-6e49e5a2-160e-487a-8b81-5fa7ca5ed664" facs="#m-d589ed09-55b7-4339-81d6-749199f5006e" label="lyrics-like">Dóminum. 3. a'. p. 167, and the following:</l><l xml:id="m-e7079fbf-0dad-4ee6-8327-585a386cedc2" facs="#m-5f598843-dbf2-4be4-99ab-ecc6f23f5e1d" label="text-like">At Magn.</l><l xml:id="m-76a1ce32-f1f6-4e3f-af39-720f2a56f745" facs="#m-2b3c7417-853e-4a56-b509-c07da67ce0ab" label="ambiguous">Ant. S. G</l><l xml:id="m-7b69ce63-89f0-4969-a2d8-22acce323e93" facs="#m-57dad6c3-47dd-443b-93f1-12132a60e5ff" label="ambiguous">0</l><l xml:id="m-b2262a5a-33ea-4048-a241-301b33a707c3" facs="#m-d8fbf223-85f7-4020-80aa-c4c90785d98a" label="ambiguous">in</l><l xml:id="m-0c769b8a-d6f3-4f55-b0f9-8be404384651" facs="#m-1f97d5d9-b716-436f-81dd-21b55679f4f2" label="lyrics-like">-mnes sunt *admi-nistra-tó-ri-i spí-ri-tus.</l><l xml:id="m-2a276ad5-4271-4a0e-a663-4d4c5dfe986b" facs="#m-56f85aa3-d472-45b0-940f-e067144d2147" label="lyrics-like">ministé-ri-um míssi propter é- os qui haeredi-tá-tem cá¬</l><l xml:id="m-dc2b1dc0-63b9-4f5b-a94e-8120b9083f84" facs="#m-5276094d-fdc2-4709-bbc7-cc43527284a6" label="lyrics-like">pi-unt sa-lú-tis. E u o u a e.</l><l xml:id="m-b39775af-756b-4c1a-8fad-6bb96ffb9f4a" facs="#m-641d97aa-4037-4336-9dff-e1e046706bff" label="lyrics-like">Cant. Magníficat. 8. G. p. 212.</l><l xml:id="m-3758c42f-a5dc-4cb3-8124-f2c1e049d6eb" facs="#m-726ba97b-ba7e-4ffc-9e2a-2fe129dd9908" label="lyrics-like">Prayer. Deus qui ineffábili. as below.</l><l xml:id="m-5301b501-eb41-4408-8c13-7ffdc31a13cc" facs="#m-0039257e-7914-4ab6-b0fc-eb59d87836b7" label="text-like">At Mass.</l><l xml:id="m-bebc9c5c-9ab7-4e0c-a45d-0621fbda59ca" facs="#m-b0f22a75-c5dc-457d-8c02-9c4d8f185e29" label="text-like">Introit. Benedicite. p. 1653.</l><l xml:id="m-f8515729-ea59-42a9-84f7-f4f32fafcb51" facs="#m-f9a80bc2-9793-4492-94e2-916fca7206fc" label="ambiguous">Collect.</l><l xml:id="m-3bd2650e-8f30-4900-ad4a-9016c5db2ac5" facs="#m-0b14f56f-e374-42e2-b983-4f729009daac" label="lyrics-like">Eus, qui ineffábili providéntia semper protectióne deféndi,et</l><l xml:id="m-2555f04e-5495-4090-a8c2-809aa1a4e1a6" facs="#m-2585ea7d-71de-424c-9f17-2d0476daf6e5" label="lyrics-like">I sanctos Angelos tuos ad no-[aetérna societáte gaudére. Per Dó¬</l><l xml:id="m-9aea2181-7a36-4e39-a612-1874e8c0c19d" facs="#m-61c84806-b2b5-4b75-b31e-1ca6d791297a" label="lyrics-like">stram custódiam mittere dignáris:t</l><l xml:id="m-37149bf0-16fe-4206-be61-11ba847daf56" facs="#m-70318099-0895-45fc-85e8-27c0d0e7a678" label="ambiguous">minum.</l><l xml:id="m-b1993088-abf9-4fb7-8177-e9c036fe5a9c" facs="#m-5c0aa6a8-bd67-41f8-9e3a-1e98514b4146" label="lyrics-like">largire supplícibus tuis et eórum</l></lg></div></section></score></mdiv></body></music>
